			</heading>
			<begin-paragraph>
			</begin-paragraph>
			<v n="1">to those who are<crossref let="d" cid="c19073001.2" />pure in heart .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19073002">
			</marker>
			<v n="2">my steps had nearly slipped .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19073003">
			</marker>
			<v n="3">when I saw the<crossref let="g" cid="c19073003.3" />prosperity of the wicked .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19073004">
			</marker>
			<v n="4">their bodies are fat and sleek .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19073005">
			</marker>
			<v n="5">they are not<crossref let="h" cid="c19073005.1" />stricken like the rest of mankind .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19073006">
			</marker>
			<v n="6">violence covers them as<crossref let="j" cid="c19073006.2" />a garment .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19073007">
			</marker>
			<v n="7">their hearts overflow with follies .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19073008">
			</marker>
			<v n="8">loftily they threaten oppression .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19073009">
			</marker>
			<v n="9">and their tongue struts through the earth .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19073010">
			</marker>
			<v n="10">and find<crossref let="m" cid="c19073010.1" />no fault in them .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19073011">
			</marker>
			<v n="11">Is there knowledge in the Most High ? ”</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19073012">
			</marker>
			<v n="12">always at ease , they<crossref let="o" cid="c19073012.1" />increase in riches .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19073013">
			</marker>
			<v n="13">and<crossref let="q" cid="c19073013.2" />washed my hands in innocence .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19073014">
			</marker>
			<v n="14">and<crossref let="r" cid="c19073014.2" />rebuked<crossref let="s" cid="c19073014.3" />every morning .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19073015">
			</marker>
			<v n="15">I would have betrayed<crossref let="t" cid="c19073015.1" />the generation of your children .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19073016">
			</marker>
			<v n="16">it seemed to me<crossref let="u" cid="c19073016.1" />a wearisome task ,</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19073017">
			</marker>
			<v n="17">then I discerned their<crossref let="w" cid="c19073017.2" />end .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19073018">
			</marker>
			<v n="18">you make them fall to ruin .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19073019">
			</marker>
			<v n="19">swept away utterly by<crossref let="z" cid="c19073019.2" />terrors !</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19073020">
			</marker>
			<v n="20">O Lord , when<crossref let="b" cid="c19073020.2" />you rouse yourself , you despise them as phantoms .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19073021">
			</marker>
			<v n="21">when I was pricked in heart ,</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19073022">
			</marker>
			<v n="22">I was like<crossref let="d" cid="c19073022.2" />a beast toward you .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19073023">
			</marker>
			<v n="23">you<crossref let="e" cid="c19073023.1" />hold my right hand .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19073024">
			</marker>
			<v n="24">and afterward you will<crossref let="g" cid="c19073024.2" />receive me to glory .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19073025">
			</marker>
			<v n="25">And there is nothing on earth that I desire besides you .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19073026">
			</marker>
			<v n="26">but God is<crossref let="j" cid="c19073026.2" />the strength of my heart and my<crossref let="k" cid="c19073026.3" />portion<crossref let="l" cid="c19073026.4" />forever .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19073027">
			</marker>
			<v n="27">you put an end to everyone who is<crossref let="n" cid="c19073027.2" />unfaithful to you .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19073028">
			</marker>
			<v n="28">that I may<crossref let="q" cid="c19073028.3" />tell of all your works .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19073029">
			</marker>
